    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n3 Coolgarten Villas is a well-presented four-bedroom end of terrace residence, ideally situated on the sought after Magazine Road, within easy reach of UCC, Cork city centre, and a host of local amenities.\n\nMaintained in good decorative condition throughout, this attractive property offers an excellent opportunity for both owner occupiers and investors seeking a home in a prime and convenient location.\n\nThe accommodation extends to an entrance hall, guest W.C., comfortable living room, and a bright open-plan kitchen/dining area on the ground floor. The first floor comprises two bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite shower facilities, together with a family bathroom. The second floor hosts two further spacious double bedrooms and an additional shower room.\n\nTo the rear, there is a private south-facing garden designed with low-maintenance living in mind, featuring a gravel finish and fully enclosed boundaries. A pedestrian gate provides direct access from the garden onto the adjoining side street, offering excellent convenience. The rear garden provides an ideal outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nThe location is second to none, within walking distance of University College Cork, Bon Secours Hospital, and Cork City Centre. The property also enjoys convenient access to Cork University Hospital, MTU, Cork Airport, and a wide range of shops, schools, restaurants, and recreational amenities.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a home or investment property in one of Cork city's most established and convenient locations.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.75m x 2.15m\nA welcoming entrance hall providing access to all ground floor accommodation. There is a laminate wood flooring and a convenient under stairs storage space.\n\nLiving Room - 5.85m x 2.93m\nBright living room to the front of the property, featuring a bay window, laminate timber flooring, and a tiled fireplace. The room enjoys an open-plan layout, flowing seamlessly into the dining area and kitchen.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 2.97m x 5.17m\nThe kitchen is fitted with a range of floor and eye-level units along with kitchen appliances. The adjoining dining area offers ample space for dining and entertaining. This bright, open-plan room enjoys excellent natural south facing light and features sliding glass doors providing direct access to the rear garden.\n\nW.C. - 1.56m x 0.76m\nTwo-piece suite with tiled flooring.\n\nLanding - 5.61m x 2.03m\nThe landing provides access to all first-floor accommodation and features timber flooring along with convenient hot press storage.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.22m x 3.02m\nSpacious double bedroom to the front of the property, featuring a bay window and solid wood flooring, and benefiting from a private shower room.\n\nShower Room - 1.96m x 1.18\nPrivate en suite shower room featuring an electric shower, wash hand basin, timber flooring, and tiled shower surround.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.50m x 5.17m\nLarge double bedroom positioned to the rear of the home features solid wood flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.96m x 1.71m\nPartially tiled family bathroom featuring a three-piece bath suite with electric shower fitting.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.48m x 3.47m\nSpacious double bedroom situated on the second floor, overlooking the rear garden and finished with solid wood flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.50m x 5.18m\nDouble bedroom situated on the second floor, overlooking the front of the property and featuring solid wood flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.31m x 1.56m\nPartially tiled three-piece bath suite with an electric shower fitting.\n\n"
      },
